        "content": "# \ud83d\udc09 Series 2 Card Compendium (Dragons Expansion)\n\nSeries 2 introduces the **Dragon Class** (7th Type) with **32 distinct dragon cards** organized into 4 elemental subclasses: **Fire**, **Ice**, **Poison**, and **Earth**.\n\nEvery dragon possesses unique offense and defensive capabilities (Armor, Ward, Healing, or Enemy Attack Debuffs). Each subclass features a balanced rarity curve with exactly **1 Exotic** card.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcca Series 2 Breakdown\n\n- **Total Cards**: 32\n- **Subclasses**: 4 (Fire, Ice, Poison, Earth) \u2014 8 cards per subclass\n- **Rarity Distribution per Subclass**:\n  - 2 Common\n  - 2 Uncommon\n  - 1 Rare\n  - 1 Epic\n  - 1 Legendary\n  - 1 Exotic\n- **Total Exotics**: 4 (*Crimson Hellkite*, *Frost Leviathan*, *Blight Dreadwyrm*, *Ancient Stone Wyrm*)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd25 Fire Dragon Subclass (Burn & Scale Defenses)\n\nFire dragons incinerate foes with persistent **Burn** while reinforcing themselves with tough, heated dragon scales (**Armor** and **Ward**).\n\n| Card # | Card Name | Rarity | Cost | ATK / Type | Defense | Primary Effects & Description |\n| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **#2-001** | **Cinder Whelp** | Common | 1 | 3 Physical | +2 Armor | Deal 3 physical damage. Inflict 2 Burn. Gain 2 Armor. |\n| **#2-002** | **Ignis Drake** | Common | 2 | 7 Magic | +3 Armor | Deal 7 magic damage. Inflict 3 Burn. Gain 3 Armor. |\n| **#2-003** | **Pyre Wyvern** | Uncommon | 2 | 9 Physical | +4 Armor | Deal 9 physical damage. Inflict 4 Burn. Gain 4 Armor. |\n| **#2-004** | **Ashmaw Drake** | Uncommon | 3 | 11 Magic | +6 Armor, +3 Ward | Deal 11 magic damage. Inflict 4 Burn. Gain 6 Armor and 3 Ward. |\n| **#2-005** | **Magma Wyrm** | Rare | 3 | 14 Magic (Splash) | +7 Armor, +5 Ward | Deal 14 magic splash damage to all enemies. Inflict 5 Burn. Gain 7 Armor and 5 Ward. |\n| **#2-006** | **Volcanic Hydra** | Epic | 4 | 20 Physical | +10 Armor, +6 Ward | Deal 20 physical damage. Inflict 6 Burn. Gain 10 Armor and 6 Ward. |\n| **#2-007** | **Inferno Tyrant** | Legendary | 5 | 28 Magic | +14 Armor, +10 Ward | Deal 28 magic damage. Inflict 8 Burn. Gain 14 Armor and 10 Ward. |\n| **#2-008** | **Crimson Hellkite** | **Exotic** | 5 | 34 Magic (Splash) | +18 Armor, +12 Ward | Deal 34 magic splash damage to all enemies. Inflict 10 Burn. Gain 18 Armor and 12 Ward. |\n\n---\n\n## \u2744\ufe0f Ice Dragon Subclass (Glacial Armor & Attack Debuffs)\n\nIce dragons chill the battlefield, reducing the enemy's attack strength (**Attack Debuff**) while coating themselves in protective glacial ice (**Armor** and **Ward**).\n\n| Card # | Card Name | Rarity | Cost | ATK / Type | Defense | Primary Effects & Description |\n| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **#2-009** | **Frost Whelp** | Common | 1 | 4 Physical | +3 Armor | Deal 4 physical damage. Gain 3 Armor. Lower enemy Attack by 2 for 2 turns. |\n| **#2-010** | **Rime Drake** | Common | 2 | 6 Magic | +5 Ward | Deal 6 magic damage. Gain 5 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 3 for 2 turns. |\n| **#2-011** | **Frost Wyrm** | Uncommon | 2 | 8 Magic | +5 Armor, +4 Ward | Deal 8 magic damage. Gain 5 Armor and 4 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 3 for 2 turns. |\n| **#2-012** | **Glacier Wyvern** | Uncommon | 3 | 10 Physical | +7 Armor, +6 Ward | Deal 10 physical damage. Gain 7 Armor and 6 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 4 for 2 turns. |\n| **#2-013** | **Blizzard Drake** | Rare | 3 | 12 Magic (Splash) | +8 Armor, +8 Ward | Deal 12 magic splash damage to all enemies. Gain 8 Armor and 8 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 5 for 3 turns. |\n| **#2-014** | **Rimefang Dragon** | Epic | 4 | 18 Magic | +12 Armor, +12 Ward | Deal 18 magic damage. Gain 12 Armor and 12 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 6 for 3 turns. |\n| **#2-015** | **Glacier Dragon** | Legendary | 5 | 24 Magic | +16 Armor, +16 Ward | Deal 24 magic damage. Gain 16 Armor and 16 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 8 for 3 turns. |\n| **#2-016** | **Frost Leviathan** | **Exotic** | 5 | 30 Magic (Splash) | +22 Armor, +22 Ward | Deal 30 magic splash damage to all enemies. Gain 22 Armor and 22 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 10 for 3 turns. |\n\n---\n\n## \u2620\ufe0f Poison Dragon Subclass (Venom & Life Siphon)\n\nPoison dragons corrode foes with deadly **Poison** while projecting caustic **Ward** and siphoning vitality to **restore Health**.\n\n| Card # | Card Name | Rarity | Cost | ATK / Type | Defense | Primary Effects & Description |\n| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **#2-017** | **Venom Spitter** | Common | 1 | 3 Magic | +3 Ward, +2 HP Heal | Deal 3 magic damage. Inflict 2 Poison. Gain 3 Ward and restore 2 HP. |\n| **#2-018** | **Muck Drake** | Common | 2 | 5 Physical | +4 Armor, +3 HP Heal | Deal 5 physical damage. Inflict 3 Poison. Gain 4 Armor and restore 3 HP. |\n| **#2-019** | **Noxious Wyvern** | Uncommon | 2 | 7 Magic | +5 Ward, +4 HP Heal | Deal 7 magic damage. Inflict 4 Poison. Gain 5 Ward and restore 4 HP. |\n| **#2-020** | **Blight Drake** | Uncommon | 3 | 10 Physical | +6 Armor, +6 Ward | Deal 10 physical damage. Inflict 4 Poison. Gain 6 Armor and 6 Ward. Lower enemy Attack by 3 for 2 turns. |\n| **#2-021** | **Toxic Basilisk** | Rare | 3 | 12 Magic (Splash) | +8 Ward, +6 HP Heal | Deal 12 magic splash damage to all enemies. Inflict 5 Poison. Gain 8 Ward and restore 6 HP. |\n| **#2-022** | **Acid Wyrm** | Epic | 4 | 18 Magic | +8 Armor, +10 Ward, +8 HP Heal | Deal 18 magic damage. Inflict 6 Poison. Gain 8 Armor, 10 Ward, and restore 8 HP. |\n| **#2-023** | **Plague Dragon** | Legendary | 5 | 24 Magic | +12 Armor, +14 Ward, +10 HP Heal | Deal 24 magic damage. Inflict 8 Poison. Gain 12 Armor, 14 Ward, and restore 10 HP. |\n| **#2-024** | **Blight Dreadwyrm** | **Exotic** | 5 | 30 Magic (Splash) | +16 Armor, +18 Ward, +14 HP Heal | Deal 30 magic splash damage to all enemies. Inflict 10 Poison. Gain 16 Armor, 18 Ward, and restore 14 HP. |\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udea8 Earth Dragon Subclass (Stun & Colossal Armor)\n\nEarth dragons are immovable bastions that crush opponents with high **Stun** chances while building massive **Armor** and **Ward**.\n\n| Card # | Card Name | Rarity | Cost | ATK / Type | Defense | Primary Effects & Description |\n| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **#2-025** | **Pebble Whelp** | Common | 1 | 3 Physical | +6 Armor | Deal 3 physical damage. Gain 6 Armor. 25% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-026** | **Stone Drake** | Common | 2 | 6 Physical | +10 Armor | Deal 6 physical damage. Gain 10 Armor. 30% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-027** | **Granite Wyrm** | Uncommon | 2 | 8 Physical | +12 Armor, +4 Ward | Deal 8 physical damage. Gain 12 Armor and 4 Ward. 35% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-028** | **Ironscale Drake** | Uncommon | 3 | 11 Physical | +16 Armor, +6 Ward | Deal 11 physical damage. Gain 16 Armor and 6 Ward. 40% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-029** | **Tectonic Wyrm** | Rare | 3 | 13 Physical (Splash) | +18 Armor, +8 Ward | Deal 13 physical splash damage to all enemies. Gain 18 Armor and 8 Ward. 50% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-030** | **Obsidian Dragon** | Epic | 4 | 18 Physical | +24 Armor, +12 Ward | Deal 18 physical damage. Gain 24 Armor and 12 Ward. 60% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-031** | **Mountain Behemoth** | Legendary | 5 | 24 Physical | +30 Armor, +16 Ward | Deal 24 physical damage. Gain 30 Armor and 16 Ward. 75% chance to Stun enemy. |\n| **#2-032** | **Ancient Stone Wyrm** | **Exotic** | 5 | 30 Physical (Splash) | +40 Armor, +20 Ward | Deal 30 physical splash damage to all enemies. Gain 40 Armor and 20 Ward. 100% chance to Stun enemy. |\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Related Notes\n- [[Series 1 Compendium]]\n- [[Card System & Anatomy]]\n- [[Card Classes & Archetypes]]\n- [[Heroes Overview]]\n- [[Dragon]]\n- [[Booster Packs & Gacha]]"
