        "content": "# \u2753 Mystery Events\n\n**Mystery Nodes (`\u2753`)** introduce interactive narrative dilemmas into the dungeon path, offering high-risk, high-reward choices that test the player's build and resourcefulness.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Encounter Catalog\n\n### 1. \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f The Cursed Altar\n> *\"An ancient crimson altar hums with dark sacrificial power. It demands blood in exchange for martial prowess.\"*\n- **Choice A: Accept Blood Pact**: +4 Base Attack, -15 Max HP.\n- **Choice B: Purify Altar**: Pay 30 Gold \u2794 Gain 45 Gems, Heal 20 HP.\n- **Choice C: Leave It Untouched**: Safely leave with no changes.\n\n### 2. \ud83e\uddea The Wandering Alchemist\n> *\"A cloaked apothecary sits beside bubbling flasks and glowing phials offering experimental draughts.\"*\n- **Choice A: Chug Glowing Flask**: 50% chance: +20 Max HP & Full Heal; 50% chance: 15 damage.\n- **Choice B: Buy Relic Distillate**: Pay 35 Gold \u2794 Gain 2 Relic Shards.\n- **Choice C: Politely Decline**: Decline and move on.\n\n### 3. \ud83d\udc09 The Sleeping Drake's Hoard\n> *\"A slumbering young drake lies curled around a glittering pile of gold coins and charred bone.\"*\n- **Choice A: Carefully Pocket Gold**: Gain 75 Gold safely.\n- **Choice B: Seize Drake Relic!**: Wake the drake! Suffer 20 damage \u2794 Gain 3 Relic Shards & 100 Gold.\n- **Choice C: Tiptoe Past Silently**: Rest quietly (+15 HP).\n\n### 4. \u2692\ufe0f The Arcane Anvil\n> *\"Ghostly blue flames burn inside a celestial forge. An ancient hammer rests on the anvil.\"*\n- **Choice A: Temper Spirit**: Gain +10 Max HP & Full Heal.\n- **Choice B: Transmute Wealth**: Pay 35 Gold \u2794 Receive 50 Gems.\n- **Choice C: Step Back**: Observe and move on.\n\n### 5. \ud83c\udccf The Whispering Deck\n> *\"A spectral card table materializes from the gloom. Ethereal cards orbit a glowing obsidian pedestal.\"*\n- **Choice A: Infuse with Void Energy**: Sacrifice 20 HP \u2794 Gain +5 Base Attack and 35 Gems.\n- **Choice B: Study Ethereal Runes**: Gain 45 Gold and 1 Relic Shard.\n- **Choice C: Walk Away Unscathed**: Leave safely.\n\n### 6. \u26f2 The Fountain of Cleansing\n> *\"A crystalline basin spills with glowing azure spring water, radiating healing celestial mist.\"*\n- **Choice A: Drink Deeply**: Restore 35 HP.\n- **Choice B: Toss Offering**: Pay 25 Gold \u2794 Gain +15 Max HP & Full Heal.\n- **Choice C: Bottle Spring Essence**: Collect 2 Relic Shards.\n\n### 7. \ud83c\udfb2 The Wandering Trickster\n> *\"A goblin jester in a velvet coat tosses prismatic dice with uncanny dexterity.\"*\n- **Choice A: High-Stakes Coin Flip**: 50% chance: Gain up to +150 Gold; 50% chance: Lose 30 Gold or take 12 damage.\n- **Choice B: Buy Trickster's Loaded Die**: Pay 40 Gold \u2794 Gain 2 Relic Shards and 25 Gems.\n- **Choice C: Refuse to Play**: Walk away safely.\n\n### 8. \u2694\ufe0f Tomb of the Forgotten Knight\n> *\"A heavy stone sarcophagus bears the runic broadsword and sigil of an ancient crusader.\"*\n- **Choice A: Pry the Blessed Blade**: Suffer 15 hex damage \u2794 Gain +6 Base Attack.\n- **Choice B: Leave Respectful Offering**: Pay 20 Gold \u2794 Receive +10 Max HP and 30 Gems.\n- **Choice C: Loot Crypt Chest**: Crack open an auxiliary chest for 60 Gold.\n\n### 9. \ud83e\ude9e The Mirror of Souls\n> *\"An ornate obsidian mirror reflects an astral apparition burning with celestial nebulae.\"*\n- **Choice A: Gaze into Astral Abyss**: Sacrifice 10 Max HP \u2794 Receive 4 Relic Shards.\n- **Choice B: Shatter the Glass Entity**: Suffer 14 damage \u2794 Gain 85 Gold and 30 Gems.\n- **Choice C: Avert Your Eyes**: Walk away safely.\n\n### 10. \ud83c\udfaa The Goblin Black Market\n> *\"A reinforced iron wagon sits guarded by lantern sentries, laden with contraband antiquities.\"*\n- **Choice A: Buy Military Iron Rations**: Pay 25 Gold \u2794 Heal 30 HP & gain +5 Max HP.\n- **Choice B: Smuggle Contraband Relic**: Pay 50 Gold \u2794 Gain 3 Relic Shards.\n- **Choice C: Pawn Battlefield Scrap**: Gain 25 Gold.\n\n### 11. \ud83c\udf0c The Starlight Nexus\n> *\"Dungeon stone gives way to an astral pocket dimension where nebula dust drifts peacefully.\"*\n- **Choice A: Cosmic Meditation**: Restore 25 HP and gather 50 Gems.\n- **Choice B: Harvest Astral Stardust**: Suffer 12 astral damage \u2794 Gain 3 Relic Shards and 60 Gold.\n- **Choice C: Absorb Ambient Quietude**: Catch your breath (+15 HP).\n\n### 12. \ud83e\ude78 The Bloodbound Merchant\n> *\"A pale aristocrat in crimson silks offers ancient reliquaries in exchange for vital essence.\"*\n- **Choice A: Sacrifice Blood for Power**: Suffer 20 damage \u2794 Gain +5 Base Attack and 40 Gold.\n- **Choice B: Trade Life for Relic Shards**: Suffer 25 damage \u2794 Gain 3 Relic Shards and 35 Gems.\n- **Choice C: Politely Decline**: Refuse and move on.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Related Notes\n- [[Encounter Rooms Overview]]\n- [[Dungeon Generation & Map]]\n- [[Dual Currency System]]"
