        "content": "# \ud83c\udfb2 The Gambler\n\n> *\"Fortune favors the bold... and flays the foolish. Care to roll the dice?\"*\n\n**The Gambler** (`GamblerScene.gd`) is the ultimate risk-versus-reward encounter in **Decked Out**. Spawning along dungeon paths (5.0% spawn rate, max 2 times per run, Floor 3+), the Gambler tempts players with massive multipliers and roulette thrills at the peril of physical injury or death.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfb0 Gambling Games & Wagers\n\n### 1. Wager Gold for Gems (The 50/50 Coin Flip)\n- The player inputs an amount of **Gold (IRC)** to bet (max 3 wagers per visit).\n- Quick presets available: `25`, `50`, `100`, `Half`, `Max`.\n- A 50/50 roll is performed:\n  - **50% Chance to Win**: Win **2.5x the wager in Gems**! (`Wager * 2.5`).\n  - **50% Chance to Lose**: Suffer direct HP damage equal to $\\text{Wager} / 5$.\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> If a failed wager reduces the hero's current HP to 0 or below, **the hero instantly dies**, the run terminates, and the save file's active run data is wiped!\n\n### 2. The Wheel of Fate (Roulette Minigame)\n- 1 Spin per visit (Costs **30 Gold**).\n- Spin the 6-slice wheel of fortune with animated decelerating roulette:\n  - \ud83d\udc8e **Jackpot**: +150 Gems\n  - \ud83d\udcb0 **Gold Rush**: +75 Gold\n  - \u26a1 **Alchemical Surge**: Upgrades a random card in your active run deck\n  - \u2764\ufe0f **Life Elixir**: Restores +25 HP\n  - \u2620\ufe0f **Bad Luck**: Suffer -15 HP damage\n  - \ud83d\udcb8 **Pickpocket**: Lose 40 Gold\n\n### 3. Risk a Card Challenge\n- Select a card from your active run deck to wager:\n  - **40% Chance to Win**: Keep the card permanently in your persistent Binder collection **+ Receive 150 bonus Gems**!\n  - **60% Chance to Lose**: The card is permanently deleted from your run deck!\n\n### 4. Devil's Pact (High-Risk Mode)\n- For desperate adventurers or glass-cannon strategies:\n  - **Effect**: Grants **+100% Damage** for the next 2 combat waves.\n  - **Permanent Penalty**: Permanently sacrifices **25% of the hero's Max HP** for the remainder of the run.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Related Notes\n- [[Dual Currency System]]\n- [[Encounter Rooms Overview]]\n- [[Combat Mechanics]]"
