        "content": "# \ud83d\udc80 Act 1 Boss Pool\n\nAt the climax of **Act 1 (Floor 12)**, players face a randomized boss from a varied encounter pool before earning passage to Act 2.\n\n---\n\n## 1. \ud83e\uddb4 Bone Amalgam\n- **Theme**: Undead Behemoth fused from thousands of skeletal remains.\n- **HP**: 220 HP | **ATK**: 14 | **Armor**: 12 | **Ward**: 0\n- **Mechanics**:\n  - High physical armor reflection and bone spikes.\n  - Sunder attacks that crack hero shields.\n- **Strategy**: Leverage magical attacks to bypass high physical armor or use armor-shred cards.\n\n---\n\n## 2. \ud83d\udd25 Archmage Ignis\n- **Theme**: Corrupted pyromancer trapped in the dungeon vault.\n- **HP**: 175 HP | **ATK**: 16 | **Armor**: 0 | **Ward**: 15\n- **Mechanics**:\n  - Inflicts heavy **Burn** stacks each turn.\n  - Flame Shield reflects damage if Ward is not broken.\n- **Strategy**: Burst down Ward early with physical strikes, utilize cleansing elixirs and heal cards.\n\n---\n\n## 3. \u2699\ufe0f Wreckyard Colossus\n- **Theme**: Rusted iron titan resurrected by Goblin junk-sorcery.\n- **HP**: 260 HP | **ATK**: 18 | **Armor**: 15 | **Ward**: 5\n- **Mechanics**:\n  - Crushing Blows with high screen-shake impact.\n  - Steam Vent: deals damage to the hero whenever cards are discarded.\n- **Strategy**: Pacing is critical; avoid wasteful discards and burst with high-impact single-target finishers.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udeaa Transition to Act 2 & Act 3\nDefeating an Act 1 Boss reveals the **\"Proceed to Act 2\"** gate:\n- **Inter-Act Deck Refresh**: All cards in your discard pile are automatically shuffled back into the draw deck so your full deck is available for Act 2.\n- Collect Act 1 boss spoils (50 Gold, 15 Gems, Rare Card selection).\n- Transitions to the Act 2 Map (Floors 1\u201310) featuring intensified encounters.\n- Defeating the Act 2 Boss refreshes the deck again and unlocks the **Proceed to Act 3** gateway (Floors 1\u201318), culminating in the climactic confrontation with [[Boss - Dragon Lord]] and [[Boss - The God]].\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Related Notes\n- [[Boss - Dragon Lord]]\n- [[Dungeon Generation & Map]]\n- [[Enemy Stats & Scaling]]"
