        "content": "# \ud83c\udfb5 Soundtrack & Audio Design\n\nAudio in **Decked Out** is managed through `AudioManager.gd`, providing immersive atmospheric ambiance across dungeon exploration, tense tactical combat encounters, and victory fanfare.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfbc Original Soundtrack (OST Tracks)\n\n| Track File | Title / Theme | Intended Scene / Atmosphere |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Crowns_Of_Hell_Decked_Out.mp3` | **Crowns of Hell** | High-intensity combat, boss encounters, and infernal floors. |\n| `Deck_Of_Ash_Decked_Out_V2.mp3` | **Deck of Ash (V2)** | Dark, brooding dungeon delve and tension theme. |\n| `Forked_Paths_Decked_Out.mp3` | **Forked Paths** | Exploration theme for the procedural Dungeon Map. |\n| `Gold_In_Dust_Decked_Out.mp3` | **Gold in Dust** | Merchant theme for Shops, The Trader, and The Chemist. |\n| `Shattered_Hand_Decked_Out_V2.mp3` | **Shattered Hand (V2)** | Intense tactical combat and dangerous elite duels. |\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd0a Sound Effects System (SFX)\n\nCategorized into custom Godot Audio Buses:\n- **Card Interaction**: Card draw swishes, card hover clicks, and card slam sound triggers.\n- **Combat Feedback**: Heavy physical impacts, armor clangs, magic sizzles, and burn/bleed ticks.\n- **Pack Opening Fanfare**: Tear sounds, card reveals, and rare/exotic celebratory chime stingers.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd17 Related Notes\n- [[Godot Project Architecture]]\n- [[Combat Mechanics]]\n- [[Booster Packs & Gacha]]"
